%% UC-21 — Manage cue pools (CRUD + CSV import)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (cuePoolService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    R->>AP: Open Cue Pools page
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/cue-pools
    B->>M: find(cue_pools)
    B-->>AP: cues {text, quality, dimensions, domain, language}
    alt single cue CRUD
        R->>AP: Add / edit / delete cue
        AP->>B: POST / PUT / DELETE /api/v1/admin/cue-pools/:id
        B->>M: write(cue_pools)
    else bulk CSV import
        R->>AP: Upload CSV of pre-rated cues
        AP->>B: POST /api/v1/admin/cue-pools/import (multipart)
        B->>B: Parse + validate rows (quality, dimensions 1-5)
        B->>M: insertMany(cue_pools)
        B-->>AP: import report {inserted, rejected}
    end
    B-->>AP: 200
